{"title":"Sweat & Tone Class","startsAt":"2026-10-05T18:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-05T19:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Want to start your week strong?\n\nJoin us every Monday for a 50-minute, music-driven, full-body workout combining cardio bursts, mat-based strength work, and core training. Inspired by the precision and controlled movements of barre, this workout will leave you feeling open and energized.\n\nStarting September 28th at 6 pm. Just bring your mat and be ready to move. All fitness levels are welcome.\n\nLocation:\nDance Annex studio 509a\n509 Bloor St W 2nd Floor,\nToronto, ON M5S 1Y2\n\nPlease register here to attend: https://danastrainingto.simplybook.me/v2/\n\nEmail danastrainingTO@gmail.com with any questions.","venue":{"name":"509 Bloor Street West","address":"509 Bloor St W, Toronto, ON M5S 1Y2, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.66548,"lng":-79.4084,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Sweat & Tone Group Fitness","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/b/5/a/d/highres_536326509.jpeg"}